  "description": "Idiomatic .NET client for PayPal's Partner APIs: seller onboarding (Partner Referrals), Checkout Orders (create/capture/authorize), Captures/Authorizations/Refunds, Webhooks with signature verification, Vault payment tokens, Apple Pay domains, and Shipment Tracking. Handles OAuth2 client-credentials token caching and refresh automatically - no manual HTTP or token plumbing required.",
